Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:25:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 30/94] Input: misc: add the HiBy volume wheel

The HiBy RS6 volume wheel is a two-GPIO rotary encoder that reports
KEY_VOLUMEUP/KEY_VOLUMEDOWN, one key press per detent.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SXjPGasJxD6XRYU1J9jsnW
